  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A shelf key can reach several shelves: byteshelf key grant gives a key another shelf or changes its access there, key ungrant takes one (deleting the key with its last), key delete takes a key id and deletes the key from every shelf, and keys lists each key with all its shelves. Over --mcp a tool may leave the shelf out only when the login reaches one shelf. Made for ByteShelf server 2.2.0, whose keys hold grants; it cannot manage keys on a 2.1.0 server. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/byte-shelf/blob/cli-v2.2.0/ByteShelf.Cli/README.md",
